#12913
parts companion plated eventide elemental~
plated eventide elemental companion parts~
Some plated eventide elemental companion parts are here.~
   These modular parts are used to construct an eventide elemental companion,
which you can summon and dismiss like any other companion. This elemental lasts
until it is destroyed. Each elemental is built from up to 3 modules. This
module adds tanking capabilities:
   1 plated module: It gains more health and will rescue you in combat.
   2 plated modules: Boosts its damage resistance.
   3 plated modules: Adds 'order companion' options for healing, dodging,
      taunting, and clearing itself of debuffs.
~
