darkness~
   Echo Forge seems darker now. With the bell fallen dark and any light on the
horizon blocked by the great serragon, the stars alone light the arena.
~
E
wall walls~
   That's no wall! The shifting mass encircling Echo forge is, in reality, a
tremendous serragon! Even as it moves, it's hard to see, as its serrated scales
trap all light.
~
E
floor tiles tiled down~
   Blue-black metal tiles make up the floor of Echo Forge. There's a loud TAP
sound each time you take a step. Debris from the serragon's movements litters
the floor.
~
E
out around ne nw se sw northeast southeast northwest southwest north south east west circle~
   The metal tiles extend to the edge of the circle in all directions, though
they stop well short of the massive serragon!
~
E
pools water reflecting reflection~
   Pools of water radiate from the center of Echo Forge to the edges. You can
watch the serragon's movements in the reflection, as it blocks most of the
stars.
~
E
tail~
   The serragon's long tail tapers to a fine point. The tail sweeps back and
forth across Echo Forge, tapping at the ground, the arches, and occasionally
even the red-hot forges.
~
